  <jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(3) &lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;【その他】&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:17.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:8.9pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;  該当事項はありません。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:18.0pt;font-size:18.0pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfOperationalProceduresForSharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h2 class="smt_head1"&gt;第６ 【提出会社の株式事務の概要】&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;"&gt;
